## Architecture Invariants

Enforced by `./scripts/check-crate-deps.sh`:

- Crate dependency direction:
  `flequit-types -> flequit-model -> flequit-repository -> flequit-core ->
  flequit-infrastructure-* -> flequit-infrastructure -> flequit-ui -> flequit-app`
  (`flequit-platform` is a leaf crate depending only on `flequit-types`)
- `#[cfg(target_os = ...)]` only inside `flequit-platform`
- `.slint` holds no business logic and never references domain types
- Only ViewModels call `flequit-core` facades
- Never block the UI thread; background UI updates go through `upgrade_in_event_loop()`
